(text "PROPOSED BENCH ASSEMBLY - NOT RELEASED FOR PCB OR ANIMAL USE" (at 20 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.75 1.75)) (justify left)) (uuid a90e43e1-e925-4336-9292-599e07af60d7))
(text "Logical module interfaces only. Use manufacturer PAD NAMES, not these symbol pin numbers." (at 20 36 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 5012f96e-a6dc-4ec7-95c5-03ca4ea723c5))
(text "J1 cavity 1 = panel positive; cavity 2 = return. Verify both mating halves with a meter." (at 20 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 9555b789-7187-4e65-812f-38075df6ccd7))
(text "D1: unbanded ANODE faces panel; banded CATHODE faces regulator VIN." (at 20 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid c27237f0-ad10-4383-911d-a9c861fb66bb))
(text "A2 SHDN and PG: leave unconnected. A3/J2 D+ and D-: leave unconnected." (at 20 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid a311e5c0-2df5-4ea7-9df6-370982e7ffd2))
(text "R12 on A4: existing 2k ~500 mA; conditional bench proposal 10k ~100 mA after battery review." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 7a0878fc-554f-4fa8-a4bd-418115d5b2c7))
(text "No MPPT or solar input power tracking. Shade, brownout and battery takeover require bench tests." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 25cd1454-3009-4fc6-bb4a-56f137c98ae2))
(text "Use ONLY A4 USB-C for solar input. NEVER plug a panel into the board battery JST J5." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid aaed5952-3396-46f9-b720-55320e33dd51))
(text "One VBUS source only. Identify battery/charger variant and temperature limits before charging." (at 20 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 070d958c-ef8d-4d6a-8864-3ab0f3986e79))
(text "Mass: user baseline 120 g + panel 79 g + regulator 1 g = 200 g BEFORE remaining parts." (at 20 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 1ef57998-9de9-4eb0-ad40-55b9a1ec6d08))
(text "Panel is 112 x 136 mm. Mounting area unknown. Final installed mass must be <=240 g." (at 20 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 4c4291cc-6c0d-4c50-8578-e3529df595ec))
(text "Sources, BOM, exact wire list and limitations: README.md in this directory." (at 20 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 76a95218-f365-4c93-8403-50823d31ff58))
